.TH SOFT 1 "2026-08-07" "soft" "A self-hostable Git server for the command line"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
soft \- A self-hostable Git server for the command line
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsoft\fP [\fIoptions\&.\&.\&.\fP] [\fIargument\&.\&.\&.\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Soft Serve is a self-hostable Git server for the command line\&.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBadmin\fP
.RS 4
Administrate the server
.RE
.TP
\fBCOMMANDS\fP
.RS 4
\fBmigrate\fP
.RS 4
Migrate the database to the latest version
.RE
.TP
\fBrollback\fP
.RS 4
Rollback the database to the previous version
.RE
.TP
\fBsync-hooks\fP
.RS 4
Update repository hooks
.RE
.RE
.TP
\fBbrowse\fP PATH
.RS 4
Browse a repository
.RE
.TP
\fBhelp\fP [command]
.RS 4
Help about any command
.RE
.TP
\fBserve\fP
.RS 4
Start the server
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--sync-hooks\fP
synchronize hooks for all repositories before running the server
.RE
